    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A meteor crashes to earth revealing a map to the stars. Project Icarus is formed to send a team of astronauts back to the source of the message. Join the crew of the Icarus as they land on a mysterious desert planet. What are the strange plants that grow in the caves? Who built the massive long abandoned pyramid?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Gate is an interactive science fiction graphic novel. At various points in the story, you will be asked to make a choice, these choices will take you down different paths in the story. Your objective as you guide the story is to return back to earth. The game features 3 possible story endings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
